{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4bLGfvQZJb7gFQ5rQx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before a plain, weathered door. There is a single keyhole, tarnished brass, at its center.*\n\n*The keyhole stares back at you like an unblinking eye.*\n\n**CLICK.**\n\n*A faint draft breathes through from the other side — cold, ancient, carrying the smell of stone and forgotten rooms. The door trembles almost imperceptibly, as if it remembers being opened once, long ago.*\n\n*The keyhole waits.*\n\n**What do you insert?**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":116,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}